# 🛡️ Day 50 – Defend Your Experience

> **AI-Powered Interview Preparation & Experience Defense Platform built with Claude AI**

## 📌 Overview

**Defend Your Experience** is an AI-powered interview preparation application that helps users confidently defend every claim they make about themselves.

Instead of rewriting resumes or suggesting generic interview questions, the platform extracts meaningful claims from documents such as resumes, LinkedIn profiles, portfolios, project descriptions, research papers, startup stories, and performance reviews. It then acts as an intelligent skeptic, generating personalized follow-up questions that challenge users to explain, justify, and support every achievement with evidence.

The result is a realistic interview experience that builds confidence, uncovers weak areas, and prepares users to communicate their experiences effectively.

