## 🧠 Interview Workflow

The application transforms uploaded experiences into an adaptive interview that becomes more challenging as the conversation progresses.

```text
Upload Resume / Portfolio
          │
          ▼
Claim Extraction Engine
          │
          ▼
Experience Analysis
          │
          ▼
AI Skeptical Interviewer
          │
          ▼
